{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the nebula. Power up your thrusters. Become the last line of defense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nebula Invaders</strong> is a 2D arcade action game where every move, every shot, and every explosion matters. Pilot a fast and responsive spaceship through a minimalist starfield and take on waves of colorful enemies, each with unique shapes and attack patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy invaders to collect bonuses, upgrade your weapons, and challenge powerful bosses whose defeat will grant you even greater ship enhancements. No story, no mercy\u2014just you, your reflexes, and a dazzling neon storm in the endless void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf20 Fast-paced, fluid arcade gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Ship and weapon upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e Intense boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab Neon aesthetic inspired by TRON and classic arcade shooters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Progressive difficulty for an ever-growing challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a nostalgic fan of retro shooters or simply looking for a thrilling, hypnotic action experience, <strong>Nebula Invaders</strong> will pull you into a cosmic dance of light and destruction where precision is survival.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4093700/0d54186080542edc1426598acec0d2bbb0533a99.jpg"},{"name":"Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4093700/a4eef62771abdde96c48a4dc4666942da5f2cb02.jpg"},{"name":"Level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4093700/3a2d89c839e481ff1548c9b2ba